  "issues": [
    {
      "severity": "note",
      "source": "api (shape)",
      "detail": "Shape rounds the table's outer corners (radius/element-md, clipping its content) and sets the matching shape option on every nested component (Shape on Search, Icon Button, Button, Checkbox; Rounded on Status Label and Pagination). In code, pass it down to the components the table renders; content a consumer slots in (controls, custom cells) has to be told separately or read it from context."
    },
    {
      "severity": "warn",
      "source": "gaps",
      "detail": "Shape=sharp leaves the table's radius as a raw 0 with no token; rounded binds radius/element-md. Elsewhere sharp corners bind radius/none."
    },
    {
      "severity": "warn",
      "source": "_Label / _Header Cell",
      "detail": "_Label's sort property is bound to nothing: the _Sort instance is always visible and never changes. _Header Cell's Sorted axis only flips that dead property — and inversely (Sorted=true sets sort=false). Sorted therefore has no visible effect, and no header variant sets _Sort's direction. Build sort state from _Sort's own direction axis; don't reproduce Sorted."
    },
    {
      "severity": "warn",
      "source": "dependencies",
      "detail": "Table Column/true (6050:4835), used in Table Content's two frozen variants, is not on any page — an orphaned main component. Its end stroke weight is raw 1 with no token (stroke/thin elsewhere)."
    },
    {
      "severity": "warn",
      "source": "effects",
      "detail": "The frozen column's shadow (effect style Shadow/medium-horizontal) binds offsetX to shadow/medium/y and offsetY to shadow/medium/x (same for the small layer) to turn a vertical shadow sideways. Implement as a horizontal shadow; there are no horizontal-offset tokens."
    },
    {
      "severity": "warn",
      "source": "_Data Cell",
      "detail": "State=disabled removes the cell fill and leaves the nested content in its enabled variant, so disabled text isn't dimmed. _Avatar and text has a disabled variant that isn't used."
    },
    {
